  "kernel_source": {
    "Receiver.tla": "---- MODULE Receiver ----\nEXTENDS Age_Channel, Integers, FiniteSets\nCONSTANT Width\nVARIABLE done\nStart == /\\ inTransit = {[age |-> 2, content |-> [from |-> 1, to |-> j, type |-> \"alive\"]] : j \\in 1..Width}\n         /\\ inDelivery = {}\n         /\\ done = FALSE\nStep == /\\ ~done /\\ Deliver(1) /\\ done' = TRUE\nSafe == Cardinality(inTransit) \\in (Width-1)..Width\n====\n",
    "N40.cfg": "CONSTANTS Messages = {} Boxes = {} Width = 40\nINIT Start\nNEXT Step\nINVARIANT Safe\nCHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE\n",
    "Lose.tla": "---- MODULE Lose ----\nEXTENDS Receiver\nNotDelivered == inDelivery = {}\n====\n",
    "Lose.cfg": "CONSTANTS Messages = {} Boxes = {} Width = 40\nINIT Start\nNEXT Step\nINVARIANT Safe\nCHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE\nINVARIANT NotDelivered\n"
  },
  "kernel_config": "For the width series replace Width = 40 with the stated width. Receiver extends the unmodified Age_Channel and uses its original Deliver(1) action. The TLC-40 control rewrites only its binder to SUBSET {b \\in inTransit : b.content.to = rcver} and retains the original guard.",
